tarting Fresh - a subject worth understanding.","wisdom":"New beginnings offer opportunities for growth and change.","outro":"Wisdom worth carrying forward. Until tomorrow."}},"61-102":{"persona":"Honored Equal","phases":{"hook":"Today we reflect on: Starting Fresh. A timeless subject.","wisdom":"New beginnings offer opportunities for growth and change.","outro":"Until we meet again. Take care."}}}'::jsonb, 'approved', 'v3.0-skeleton', 'day-001-complete.js')
