that makes a difference. See you tomorrow."}},"36-60":{"persona":"Respectful Guide","phases":{"hook":"Today we explore Words That Shape Beliefs - a subject worth understanding.","wisdom":"Affirmations are positive statements that influence our mindset.","outro":"Wisdom worth carrying forward. Until tomorrow."}},"61-102":{"persona":"Honored Equal","phases":{"hook":"Today we reflect on: Words That Shape Beliefs. A timeless subject.","wisdom":"Affirmations are positive statements that influence our mindset.","outro":"Until we meet again. Take care."}}}'::jsonb, 'approved', 'v3.0-skeleton', 'day-350-complete.js')
